@baseUrl = http://localhost:5132

### 1. Get all users (projected to UserSummaryDto via Mapster)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get user by ID (detailed mapping)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create a new user (CreateUserRequest -> User entity -> UserDetailDto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sarahconnor",
  "email": "sarah.connor@example.com",
  "firstName": "Sarah",
  "lastName": "Connor",
  "bio": "Resistance Leader",
  "roles": ["User", "Moderator"],
  "theme": "Dark",
  "language": "en"
}

### 4. Update user bio and theme
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1/bio
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Lead Cloud Architect & Principal Consultant",
  "theme": "System"
}
